Chris, thanks for being here.
克里斯，谢谢你能来。

00:00:42.701 --> 00:00:49.989
Chris wrote game night episode 15, which we did a great discussion on that a couple of days ago.
克里斯写了第15集《游戏之夜》，几天前我们对这一集进行了精彩的讨论。

00:00:49.989 --> 00:00:55.380
And Chris is back to answer all your questions and dispel his memories.
克里斯这次回来是为了回答大家的所有问题，并唤醒他的回忆。

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:56.396
He's wearing the same shirt.
他穿着同一件衬衫。

00:00:56.396 --> 00:00:58.140
We're always the same clothes as a few days ago.
我们总是穿着几天前一样的衣服。

