I just want to talk about in the large this notion of big how much you were looking at big picture planning ahead or that you were just treading water.
我只想从宏观上谈谈这种“宏大”的概念，即你们在多大程度上着眼于全局、提前规划，还是仅仅在随波逐流。

00:08:23.162 --> 00:08:31.659
For example in drum roll please season one episode 13 Barney he picks up a bridesmaid saying he's going to be away for two years with the Peace Corps.
比如，请敲黑板，第一季第十三集里，巴尼搭讪了一个伴娘，说他要加入和平队离开两年。

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:42.580
Was that foreshadowing of this episode or did you just think about it as a callback or are you not noting it until I literally I'm saying it to you right now based on your thoughts.
那是对这一集的伏笔，还是你只是把它当作一个前后呼应的梗，或者直到我此刻基于你的想法直接说出来，你才注意到这一点？

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:44.620
Can I can I recover and say it was all planned?
我能、我能圆回来，说这都是计划好的吗？

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:49.659
I have no recollection of that, but we were there were there were pretty close together.
我完全不记得了，但它们当时离得确实挺近的。

00:08:49.659 --> 00:08:50.820
So I wonder we owned it.
所以我很好奇，我们认领了。

